+Subject: [PATCH 01/16] Fix Jellyfin API integration for modern Jellyfin
+ servers
+
+- Fix JELLYFIN_SERVER base URL to include /jellyfin path prefix
+  (this.auth.User was undefined because auth requests were hitting
+  a 302 redirect instead of the real API)
+- Replace jellyfin-providersid-search-plugin dependency with native
+  Jellyfin /Items API + client-side ProviderIds filtering. The plugin
+  is binary-incompatible with Jellyfin 10.11.x (MissingMethodException
+  on ILibraryManager.GetItemList) and appears unmaintained.
+- Implement defineMetaHandler properly (was hardcoded to return null)
+- Add PUBLIC_JELLYFIN_SERVER env var so poster/stream URLs returned to
+  the Stremio client use the public-facing Jellyfin address instead of
+  the internal localhost address used for the addon's own API calls
