+From 84f07ed9d6c8c3c5bc5e7f21a44ec65821cba425 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: Vaibhav <vgupta1192@gmail.com>
+Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 05:45:48 +0200
+Subject: [PATCH 16/16] fix: Seerr requests were broken for every movie/series
+ not yet in Jellyfin
+
+The whitelist from the previous fix (requestableItemIds, populated only
+from titles the catalog handler had listed) was backwards: buildRequestStream
+only ever runs when a title is NOT found in Jellyfin, but the catalog
+handler only ever lists titles that ARE in Jellyfin - so a genuinely
+missing movie/series could never get onto the whitelist, silently breaking
+Seerr for exactly the case it exists for (confirmed live).
+
