+catalog), but narrower than the original: isRequestableItemId also
+requires a real "tt<digits>" IMDb id. That's what still blocks the
+original OnlyPorn-style leak (a foreign addon's own custom id scheme was
+never going to resolve on Seerr anyway, since seerr.findByImdbId needs a
+real IMDb id), without blocking legitimate movies/series sourced from any
+catalog, mainstream or otherwise.
+
